{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Are you ready to protect your city? In <strong>Superhero Simulator</strong>, take on the rising crime rate as you patrol the streets, stop robberies, rescue civilians, and battle powerful villains. <strong>Your choices shape the city!</strong>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531260/extras/FreeRoam.gif?t=1742279246\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>SAVE THE CITY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Stop robberies, rescue civilians, and fight crime your way. Every heroic act unlocks new abilities - become the hero <strong>Goldpine</strong> needs!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531260/extras/Save.gif?t=1742279246\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>MANAGE YOUR DAILY NEEDS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Being a hero doesn\u2019t pay the bills\u2014so you\u2019ll <strong>need a job to survive. Drive a taxi, flip burgers, or find other ways</strong> to <strong>earn money</strong>  Every <strong>&quot;Gollar&quot;</strong> counts, whether it\u2019s for food, or upgrading your gear. <strong>Balance your heroic duties with everyday struggles.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531260/extras/DailyNeeds.gif?t=1742279246\" /></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>CUSTOMIZE YOUR HERO</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Design your perfect superhero AND civilian identity! Mix and match masks, capes, and armor sets to create your signature look. Your hero, your style, your legend.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531260/extras/Customize.gif?t=1742279246\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>RISE OR FALL</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Manage your <strong>health, hygiene, mental state, and respect</strong> to stay at your best. Neglect them, and your journey becomes harder. Every action shapes your legend\u2014will you rise or break under the pressure?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"></h2>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3531260?t=1742279246","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531260/f232e8f472e9d082413799c01c9f8e565377d779/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1742279246","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531260/3ee0ccf7c2c198843b47beaa66e773b27d587967/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1742279246","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531260/3ee0ccf7c2c198843b47beaa66e773b27d587967/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1742279246","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Workshop","id":51},{"description":"Steam Workshop","id":30},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Are you ready to protect your city? In <strong>Superhero Simulator</strong>, take on the rising crime rate as you patrol the streets, stop robberies, rescue civilians, and battle powerful villains. <strong>Your choices shape the city!</strong>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531260/extras/FreeRoam.gif?t=1742279246\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>SAVE THE CITY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Stop robberies, rescue civilians, and fight crime your way. Every heroic act unlocks new abilities - become the hero <strong>Goldpine</strong> needs!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531260/extras/Save.gif?t=1742279246\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>MANAGE YOUR DAILY NEEDS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Being a hero doesn\u2019t pay the bills\u2014so you\u2019ll <strong>need a job to survive. Drive a taxi, flip burgers, or find other ways</strong> to <strong>earn money</strong>  Every <strong>&quot;Gollar&quot;</strong> counts, whether it\u2019s for food, or upgrading your gear. <strong>Balance your heroic duties with everyday struggles.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531260/extras/DailyNeeds.gif?t=1742279246\" /></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>CUSTOMIZE YOUR HERO</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Design your perfect superhero AND civilian identity! Mix and match masks, capes, and armor sets to create your signature look. Your hero, your style, your legend.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531260/extras/Customize.gif?t=1742279246\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>RISE OR FALL</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Manage your <strong>health, hygiene, mental state, and respect</strong> to stay at your best. Neglect them, and your journey becomes harder. Every action shapes your legend\u2014will you rise or break under the pressure?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"></h2>","developers":["mightyraccoon! Studios"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531260/header.jpg?t=1742279246","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":{"mi